https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1728677/a1366ea9-0ab5-4aed-8781-999ae359bc0e.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1728677/a1366ea9-0ab5-4aed-8781-999ae359bc0e.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1728677/a1366ea9-0ab5-4aed-8781-999ae359bc0e.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Fully furnished 2-room apartment with balcony and lake view – Lübeck Old Town – Temporary rental\nAvailable from: 18 September 2026\nUntil: 22 December 2026\n\nI am offering my beautiful, fully furnished apartment for a temporary rental period of three months while I am abroad for a research stay.\nThe apartment is located on Lübeck’s historic Old Town Island and offers a unique combination of central location, comfort, and a beautiful view of the Mühlenteich lake.\n\nApartment\n•\t82 m2 living space\n•\t2-room apartment\n•\tLarge living and dining area with open, fully equipped kitchen\n•\tSeparate bedroom\n•\tBathroom\n•\tSeparate utility room\n•\tLarge balcony with beautiful view of the Mühlenteich\n•\tFully furnished and ready to move in\n•\tFast Wi-Fi included\n•\tTV and soundbar\n•\tWashing machine and dryer\n\nLocation\nThe apartment is located in a very central and attractive area of Lübeck Old Town.\n•\tClose to University of Lübeck\n•\tConvenient access to University Hospital Schleswig-Holstein (UKSH)\n•\tGood connection to Sana Clinics\n•\tLübeck Central Station nearby\n•\tExcellent public transport connections\n•\tSupermarkets, cafés, restaurants and shops directly outside the building\n•\tHistoric old town and waterfront areas within walking distance\nI\ndeal for\nThe apartment is particularly suitable for:\n•\tVisiting researchers/scholars\n•\tGuest scientists\n•\tDoctors and medical professionals\n•\tPhD students and postdoctoral researchers\n•\tProject employees\n•\tProfessionals staying in Lübeck temporarily\nRental conditions\n•\tRental period: 18 September 2026 – 22 December 2026\n•\tMonthly rent: €1,950 including utilities, electricity and internet\n•\tDeposit required\n•\tPrivate liability insurance and proof of financial reliability required\n\nThis is a temporary rental only.\nNot available for tourist stays or holiday rental.\nPlease introduce yourself briefly when contacting me, including your profession/institution and the reason for your stay in Lübeck.\n\n","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"yes"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"shared"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"no"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"laminate"},"garden":{"value":"no"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"pets":{"value":"no"},"playMusic":{"value":"discussable"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"no"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"82"},"tv":{"value":"yes"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"yes"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":195000,"deposit":300000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"1950.00","deposit":"3000.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":2,"moveInWindow":0,"currentOccupancy":0,"minAge":0,"maxAge":0,"preferredG